  "prompt": "Cho hình hộp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Chứng minh:\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>∥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đường chéo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> đi qua trọng tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> của hai tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> chia đoạn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> thành ba phần bằng nhau.</li></ol>",
